Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.87,0:00:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.69,0:00:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.01,0:01:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The labyrinth of the pharaoh's\Nmind is disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be regaining his memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.75,0:01:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if the Dark One is not\Nsoon defeated, all will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Egyptian gods have fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Feral,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.99,0:01:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,even your so-called deities\Nof domination were forced to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.55,0:01:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,surrender when confronted with\Nthe power of the Shadow Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,a world I created centuries ago, a world\Nthat is now converging with your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For when your people fashioned\Nthe Millennium Items,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.71,0:01:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you opened the doorway\Nto the darkness. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.05,0:01:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the human world as\Nyou know it shall tremble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.37,0:01:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My pharaoh! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me you're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.65,0:02:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, pharaoh, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.11,0:02:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's way too weak to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.03,0:02:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is your pharaoh now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.39,0:02:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.79,0:02:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He is cowering at the feet of\Nthe new lord and ruler of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.55,0:02:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do to stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.93,0:02:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We must surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, then perhaps he'll spare us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Run while you still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Before he enslaves us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.32,0:02:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.65,0:02:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Submitting is not an option!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears your soldiers disagree!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.57,0:02:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon there will be\Nnowhere to hide, mortals!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.35,0:02:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana, escort the pharaoh\Nback to the palace at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.51,0:02:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I do that, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.83,0:02:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.74,0:02:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And leave Zork to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.71,0:03:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell the pharaoh\Nof your courage, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall tell him myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.27,0:03:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of the pharaoh, I shall\Nreturn thee to the Realm of Shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish human!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.31,0:03:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark realm of which you speak is now\Nhere on Earth, where I shall reign supreme!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a trespasser, Zork!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.07,0:03:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only in this kingdom,\Nbut in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's about time someone removed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.43,0:03:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisara!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lend me your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.61,0:03:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,White dragon, come forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing's finally\Nstarting to get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.61,0:04:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the white dragon must\Nhave conquered the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.51,0:04:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And with one attack, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.03,0:04:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisara, your strength is\Ngreater than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.07,0:04:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.65,0:04:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, every creature must\Nserve the darkness. Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're taking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The White Dragon was our last hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.69,0:05:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Egypt belongs to Zork!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That Sideshow Freak defeated\NBlue Eyes and the Egyptian Gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life shall collapse\None brick at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.75,0:05:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,First Egypt, and then the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody likes a bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:05:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to run faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't go any faster than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.37,0:06:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to pick on someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.69,0:06:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you pick on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, let the battle commence!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.01,0:06:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.19,0:06:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's try this again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out, blue-eyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Egyptian counterpart\Nalready tried this and failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think your\Nfate will be any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.81,0:06:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Zork.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been smacking around virtual\Nmonsters like you ever since I could talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.93,0:06:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, my first\Nwords were Neutron Blast Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have stayed in your own world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.21,0:06:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cards and holograms are useless here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.53,0:07:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have been able\Nto handle one Blue Eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.11,0:07:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but let's see you stand up to three in\Nthe form of Blue Eyes Ultimate Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.75,0:07:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take it away,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.51,0:07:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Boys, show this ancient\Novergrown windbag how
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,we do things back home\NNeutron Blast Attack
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the last mistake you\Nshall ever make, mortals This,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.27,0:07:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.69,0:07:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare to join your other half\Nin a world of eternal darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to get past my\NBlue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.67,0:08:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I sacrifice my Marshmallon and my\NSilent Magician in order to summon this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gendora, the Dragon of Destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.09,0:08:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.85,0:08:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I had the perfect strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It was good, but not perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.65,0:08:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Because although your zombies\Nalmost wiped out my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a card that\Ncan stop them! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You were down to your last card!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you can con the luck of the draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gendora, destroy\Nevery one of his monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My monsters may be gone, but my\Nlife points aren't. Wakura's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.45,0:08:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.61,0:08:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the last card in Yuki's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.61,0:09:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if he doesn't get rid of Bokora's\Nlife points in this turn, then Yugi loses!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,After my Gandora strikes,\Nit goes to the graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And as I'm sure you know, when\None of my monsters is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.55,0:09:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,your Sword of Sealing is deactivated!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So my Silent Swordsman is free!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.85,0:09:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,4,500 attack points?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,More than enough to wipe you\Nout. Now swordsman, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I never get tired of\Nwatching you kick butt,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.41,0:09:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yug I wouldn't be\Ncelebrating if I were you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.01,0:09:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your victory is all in vain.\NWe'll see about that. Now let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, but if you want to save the\Npharaoh, I'm afraid you're too late
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:10:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were busy playing cards, Zork\Nwas busy ushering in the Age of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So despite your apparent victory here\Ntoday, in reality, I win the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.99,0:10:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! It's Tristan! You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Come on, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.25,0:10:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time for a snooze.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a world out there to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.87,0:10:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are we, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I pass out or something? Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.85,0:10:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Tribe Akura was wearing\Nyour body like a cheap suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.75,0:10:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're catching on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for you, we\Nwouldn't be trapped in this tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So thanks for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.69,0:10:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, first you double-crossed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you almost sent\NYugi to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.01,0:10:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for all the trouble, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:10:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess you heard that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the tomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be collapsing or something,\Nso let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.93,0:11:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you guys have any\Nidea where you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There really was a light\Nat the end of the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, but how do we get down?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow me, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.19,0:11:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.17,0:11:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, I can't wait to hear\Nyour next idea. Don't start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Something I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I've caused enough trouble for you\Nguys, so it's about time I paid you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.01,0:11:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.33,0:11:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.85,0:12:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.59,0:12:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In this world, if we concentrate hard\Nenough, our thoughts can become real!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guess what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's show them how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet I can take out more of\Nthose bad boys than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.33,0:12:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on, because I summon Gear Free\Nthe Iron Knight and Flame Swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.85,0:12:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll summon these dudes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Lava Battle Guard and Swamp Battle Guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.53,0:12:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.81,0:12:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to fight, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to concentrate\Nand get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.99,0:13:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I can fly. This is so cool.\NSo if we think hard enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,can we turn those punks into\Nsomething more interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's only one\Nway to find out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.81,0:13:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Porkchops and applesauce. Porkchops\Nand applesauce. Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No dice, dude Great, we\Nhave the power to fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.85,0:13:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but we can't get a decent meal\NWe're running out of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, let's kick it into\Nhyperspeed. And more, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland, what are our coordinates?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.09,0:13:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're directly above Cairo, Egypt, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.23,0:13:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.99,0:13:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mokuba in Kaiba\NCraft 2. Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat, Seto, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.75,0:13:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We've encountered an unidentified\Nillumination, sir. That looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.17,0:13:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec That's Blue\NEye's ultimate dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.49,0:14:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it me, or is there a\Ngiant hole in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The ultimate collision of light and shadow\Nhas created a bridge between our realms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have a new world to conquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The world of the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now bow before your new lord and master!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.19,0:14:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.01,0:14:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As we approach our final hour,\Nplease restore the Pharaoh's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you're back where is zork\Nnow wait you need to rest
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:15:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,mana do you see that dragon\Nwhere did it come from well while
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.31,0:15:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you were unconscious that old\Nwhite dragon was defeated by
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,zork and then came back in a\Ndifferent form it seems to be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,holding its own for now but who\Nknows how long it's gonna last
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one person I know who can\Nsummon the Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.77,0:15:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.39,0:15:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that some sort of portal is\Nopened I need the Millennium Scale Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.59,0:15:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.11,0:15:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This may be our last chance to defeat Zork\NI need all the strength I can get Kareem,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.85,0:15:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,please lend me your power Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Feral!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.25,0:15:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He's nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.33,0:15:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We have merged to become the\NMaster of Dragon Soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.31,0:16:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Saber Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Sok.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.61,0:16:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My Pharaoh, I have waited\Nmy entire life for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what must be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.19,0:17:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,With the power of Asan,\NI shall protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.13,0:17:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We now stand face to\Nface for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.39,0:17:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the light of hope against the lord of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.65,0:17:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,darkness and just as it\Nhas since the dawn of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.47,0:17:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,time darkness shall prevail that is the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,inevitable cycle of\Nexistence you see pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the universe itself was born without light\Nall that existed was a vast wasteland of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,shadows and though fleeting moments occur\Nduring which light attempts to illuminate
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.21,0:18:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,this darkness in the end it has always\Nextinguished and the same holds true for you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.35,0:18:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you are a mere flicker whose fate glow has
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.69,0:18:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,expired you're wrong there is no darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.17,0:18:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,without light it is light that gave life
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.05,0:18:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to this world zork it\Nis light that gives us
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,hope and it is light that shall defeat you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.11,0:18:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us put your theory to the test!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A thug!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.11,0:18:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No harm shall come to you, my king!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.81,0:18:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.85,0:18:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.87,0:18:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You must never surrender to the darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.97,0:18:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Light of Hope will soon arrive,\Nbearing the information that you need!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.91,0:18:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Light of Hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.17,0:19:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.49,0:19:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.15,0:19:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly as I predicted,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.71,0:19:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,everything shall return to\Ndarkness, just as it always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.51,0:19:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Help is on the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yolanda, Yolanda, Yolanda
